#!/usr/bin/env python3
"""Recover trusted proof tails from exact host-broker checkpoints.

This command never invokes Codex or a proof agent.  Preparation copies one
already accepted problem-mode checkpoint into a fresh staging workspace and
runs the case-local host trusted checker.  Publication is a separate step so a
live benchmark runner cannot overwrite or observe a partially updated case.
"""

